      "text": "Ilyu",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You look awful.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I don't know...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Kasuke",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Always have.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "First they treat me like the culprit, then use me for their investigation.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The Russian Fog...what the hell is it?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A strange role, isn't it? You never know what the next moment will bring.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Treasure. Curse. Weapon...what links them?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Old Karl",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "For my part, I support you. You're a man of simple tastes.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...I can't solve it.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The Crowd",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "That's right! Cut Dunant down with a samurai sword!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "policy": "preserve",
      "text": null
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Send the aristocracy to the guillotine!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...I'm starting to cry.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...Ilyu. Even so, I still have to question you.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You're a hopeless company man. Fine. Why not take a shower first? I'll wait in my room.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Come now. Why don't the rest of you return to your rooms? He needs his rest.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Shower Room",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I heard about Braque...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I love to paint. It lets my heart wander anywhere...but to Braque, every painting was just merchandise.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You can't live on art alone.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I don't believe you killed him.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A crime is not only the hand that strikes...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Are you saying I was involved?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I don't know. Have you ever thought your very existence might make someone suffer?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Every day...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Then we are alike...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "They use us however they please...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "And everyone grows used to being hurt...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "It hurts, doesn't it? I enjoyed our card game.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I'm not about to die with this as my last memory of you...damn it! I still don't get it! The treasure of St. Petersburg. Cursed words that destroy the nobility. A secret weapon capable of overturning the balance of power in all Europe...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What is it?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The Russian Fog the culprit demands...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The culprit is demanding the Russian Fog?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What is it?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You know, don't you?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...no.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Your voice got quiet.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...what?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What are you, Ilyu...?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Hm?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "No, nothing.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Are you scared?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I see...but Kasuke, you'll solve this, won't you?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I will.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Probably.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Second-Class Cabin",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Old geezer!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I am not senile!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "It's like a riddle of the Sphinx, young man.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Rumor sees only one side of the truth.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "So?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Each rumor describes one fragment of the same thing. Every fragment of language hides a sign.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A sign?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Exactly!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You mean the words combine to reveal another meaning?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "When people hide the truth, they substitute one word for another. Yet the words they choose still carry traces of the truth beneath them.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "So?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "So impatient.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "In this case, the answer is clearly a person, you see.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You mean the culprit wants to seize one particular person?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Most likely.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Royal Suite A",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The Russian Fog is a person...probably a soldier with considerable combat experience, directly under the Russian Emperor...hostile to the aristocracy...no, tasked with monitoring the aristocracy.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Ashby",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "\"Overturn Europe's balance of power\"...\"curse the aristocracy to death\"...\"the Emperor's cherished treasure\"...and your answer is \"a person\"? That's quite a leap.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Dunant",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The Russian court swarms with intelligence agents. Capture one close to the Tsar and you gain his plans, habits, and intentions. That knowledge is worth sinking a floating palace.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "This is an intelligence war between great powers.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "So the Russian Fog is an intelligence agent directly under the Russian Emperor. Then which hostile nation would want such an agent most?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The British Empire.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "One more.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I hate to admit it, but the Empire of Japan is also among the principal suspect nations. The bomb is Japanese-made, after all.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Abstract theories will not solve this. Crimes are committed by people, not nations. A nation cannot be arrested.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "We live in an age of empires free to plunder.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "There are many nations I would gladly put behind bars.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Enough talk! If the Russian Fog is a person, bring them here right now!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "If we knew who it was, we wouldn't be struggling.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The culprit demands the Russian Fog and threatens to sink the ship.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "How does the culprit intend to remove the Russian Fog from the ship?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Figuring that out is our job! Move!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Aft Deck",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Voysey",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Mr. Yamada.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Those hard eyes...he's no civilian.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Hello.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Voysey. About you.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "That master of yours is stubborn.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Right?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "He is not my master.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "He is my subordinate.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What do you mean?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...what did you say?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Sharp. Even a professional spy might miss that.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...what?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "My friend here asked who you are.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Aubrey Voysey. Deputy Chief of British Intelligence Action. Ashby is one of its agents.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Wait, calm down...keep quiet and listen, Kasuke.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Then all of this...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I wore several masks. They were meant to fool the Russian agents.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "So that whole performance was for them...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A Russian spy...then the Russian Fog...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Just as you said.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A Russian agent working directly for the Tsar.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "No wonder it was confusing...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "No more lies.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "It began a year ago.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "An anonymous cable reached our London office.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "British Intelligence officer Heynwood is a Russian spy.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Heynwood was my subordinate. I didn't believe the accusation. Six months later, a second message came, this time signed.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Barnes of British Intelligence is a spy for Russia.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I am the Russian Fog.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Our London office holds the intelligence archives that support the British Empire. I searched them.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I was astonished.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Code name: Russian Fog.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "An intelligence operative reporting directly to the Russian Emperor.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Active in the St. Petersburg court since 1897.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Many nobles were executed after denunciations by the Russian Fog.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Active in various foreign countries since 1903 as an anti-British and anti-Japanese agent.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Eliminated many Anglo-Japanese agents who aided Russian revolutionaries.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A high-level organization directly under the Emperor, separate from Russian Army Intelligence. Its potential store of intelligence is",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Enough to overturn the future balance of power.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The highest-priority target of every anti-Russian intelligence service.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A major Russian spy.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Then why expose Russian agents in Britain?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The final message arrived this January.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Wait aboard NOSTALGIA.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Signal: MEDE.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "London",
      "layout_policy": "fixed"
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Deputy Chief",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Regrettably, Director. Our investigation confirms that Heynwood and Barnes are Russian agents.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Director",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Then every allegation made by the Russian Fog was true.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Yes.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What does the Russian Fog want?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Considering all the circumstances...I believe there is only one answer: defection.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A Russian spy defecting to the British Empire?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "NOSTALGIA is an American passenger ship bound from New York across the North Atlantic to Britain. As for 'Mede,' London is still deciphering it. The bombing and hijacking were a perfect demonstration of the value of the intelligence being offered.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "A prospective defector's calling card.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "We cannot allow such a prize to escape us.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "It may be bait intended to draw you out.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I accept the risk. If it comes to that, I still have the nerve to take my own life. This is no job for a younger man. Let me have one last assignment before I retire.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Take Ashby with you. He may prove useful.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I see...so, did you make contact with the Russian Fog?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "We don't know what 'Mede' means. Until we do, our hands are tied. Then, while we were stuck, this bomber hijacked the ship.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Then the hijacking is tied to the defection.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The culprit knows who the Russian Fog is.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Russian counterintelligence may be trying to stop the defection, or a third nation may be trying to seize the agent.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Madness. The whole world has gone mad.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The culprit may be one person, but that person carries out a nation's will.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Besides the Russian Fog, other spies must be aboard. Russian counterintelligence often assigns several agents to watch one target without telling them of one another.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Come on, I'm an amateur...can I really stand on the same stage as professional spies?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Two British agents, two Russians...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Perhaps an agent from a third nation. The culprit is one of them.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "And the Russian Fog...every time I start this, I regret it.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I got myself into a dangerous game...do you know how this feels?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You have my sympathy.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Cafe de Ritz",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The Deputy Chief is an idiot too, trusting an amateur like you.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "What a sarcastic bastard.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You've got a good eye for people.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Dunant is looking for the Russian Fog.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I'm getting sick of this.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You hired a fine detective.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "That clears me of suspicion.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I want to ditch this...beer! Beer! I want a beer!",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "...not yet, right?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Why not? I'm Dunant's employer, and he's effectively your superior. Show some respect.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "And?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The announcements from the wireless room and captain's cabin still point to you.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You pry too much. Being a salesman is a vulgar profession.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "You...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Still better than being a spy.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Captain's Cabin",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "One bomb remains. It will explode at 7:00 p.m.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Warning: Do not touch the bomb.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Again: recover the Russian Fog.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "That is the only way to save the ship.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "This is the final warning.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Why the hurry...?",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "Captain",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "I last left this room at 2:51 p.m. It is now 3:05.",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "policy": "translate",
      "text": "The fourteen minutes from 2:51 to 3:05...",
      "layout_policy": "adaptive"
    }
  ]
}
